<!-- 8 Detection layers -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">Solution &middot; methodology</div>
  <h1>Hybrid detection: each layer covers the others' blind spots</h1>
  <div class="grid3" style="margin-top:16px">
    <div class="card" style="border-top:5px solid var(--rule)">
      <span class="badge b-rule">RULE</span><h3 style="margin-top:8px">Deterministic</h3>
      <ul><li>Taiwan national ID with <b>checksum</b> (flags OCR-damaged IDs too)</li>
        <li>Luhn-valid card numbers, bank accounts, NHI, MRN, plates, e-mail, phones</li>
        <li>ROC (民國) and Western dates; date-of-birth from nearby labels</li>
        <li><b>Form-field anchoring</b>: value after 姓名 / 住址 / Name / Address</li></ul>
      <p style="margin-top:8px" class="note">&lt; 5 ms per page &middot; explainable &middot; highest precision</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="border-top:5px solid var(--llm)">
      <span class="badge b-llm">LLM</span><h3 style="margin-top:8px">Contextual</h3>
      <ul><li>Reads numbered OCR lines, quotes each entity exactly &rarr; mapped back to pixels</li>
        <li>Names in narrative, full addresses, quasi-identifiers</li>
        <li>Assigns a <b>role</b>: subject, professional, party, witness, family &mdash; policies act on roles</li>
        <li>Compact line output (3&times; fewer tokens than JSON); entity propagated to every repeat mention</li></ul>
      <p style="margin-top:8px" class="note">Qwen3 (Apache-2.0) &middot; local, temperature 0</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="border-top:5px solid var(--vlm)">
      <span class="badge b-vlm">VLM</span><h3 style="margin-top:8px">Visual</h3>
      <ul><li>Grounded detection of handwritten signatures, portrait photos and seals</li>
        <li>Red-ink colour segmentation finds seals deterministically and <b>snaps</b> VLM boxes to the ink</li>
        <li>Input sized to the model's 28-px patch grid so coordinates map back 1:1</li></ul>
      <p style="margin-top:8px" class="note">Qwen2.5-VL (Apache-2.0) + OpenCV</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px;background:#fff">
    <h3>Example from the evaluation corpus &mdash; one sentence, three detections</h3>
    <p class="mono" style="font-size:14px;margin-top:6px">{{ ex.title }} <span style="background:#e4572e;color:#fff;padding:0 4px">{{ ex.name }}</span> is a patient who works as
      <span style="background:#ff006e;color:#fff;padding:0 4px">{{ ex.quasi }}</span>. The patient was admitted on
      <span style="background:#c99700;color:#fff;padding:0 4px">{{ ex.date }}</span> ...</p>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:6px">rule: title + surname &middot; LLM: quasi-identifier (no regex can express "unique job in a small place") &middot; rule: calendar date &middot; all three removed in <span class="mono">{{ ex.doc }}</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span>RedactAgent &middot; ASUS UGen AI League 2026</span><span>8</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 9 Policies triptych -->
